OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFog and low cloud clear
OL,6,Fsteadily leaving a dry day with light
OL,7,Fwinds and plenty of sunshine. Feeling
OL,8,Frather mild with temperatures slightly
OL,9,Fabove average.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FLow cloud and patchy rain
OL,12,Farrive in the north, pushing
OL,13,Fsouthwards overnight. In southern
OL,14,Fareas mist and fog patches develop by
OL,15,Fearly morning. A chillier night than
OL,16,FFriday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
