OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FLow cloud and patchy rain move
OL,6,Fsouth through the day, clearing by the
OL,7,Fevening. After it passes, dry with
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Light winds and
OL,9,Ftemperatures near the average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FLargely fine and settled with high
OL,13,Fpressure in charge. Cloudier on
OL,14,FTuesday with a few showers around.
OL,15,FTemperatures near average but feeling
OL,16,Fchilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
